 "Q3_archetype_mix_bridged_vs_not": {
  "question": "Do teams whose home venue carries an S&P 500 company's name have a different player-archetype mix from teams that do not?",
  "expected_before_running": "NO. Naming rights are a commercial fact about a building and nothing connects them to roster composition. Stated before the number, not after.",
